    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Finethir, where can I find Noke and the wand, and how do I get there?",
      "event_id": 551,
      "citations": [],
      "rules_edition": null,
      "ruling_citation_ids": [],
      "turn_id": null,
      "roll_status": null,
      "roll": null,
      "created_at": "2026-10-22T10:38:36.193113Z"
    },
    {
      "role": "dm",
      "content": "Finethir answers through the scroll, his voice still carrying that odd bleat. “Noke lives in my former home, southeast of town. Take the road out of town until a well-trodden path branches off, a few miles out. Follow it through sparse woodland for about a mile, and you’ll reach the house.”\n\nHe adds that Noke keeps the wand on him and leaves the home only if absolutely necessary. The ornate scroll remains between the sheep’s jaws as the sounds of hooves and startled yelps linger nearby. What do you do next?",
      "event_id": 551,
      "citations": [
        {
          "page": 1,
          "source": "wild_sheep_chase_chapter_source_fidelity_demonstration",
          "audience": "player",
          "page_end": 1,
