    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I stand beside Finethir in plain view and wait for the approaching pursuers to arrive.",
      "event_id": 554,
      "citations": [],
      "rules_edition": null,
      "ruling_citation_ids": [],
      "turn_id": null,
      "roll_status": null,
      "roll": null,
      "created_at": "2026-10-22T10:38:47.542636Z"
    },
    {
      "role": "dm",
      "content": "You remain beside Finethir as the commotion reaches you. A hulking half-orc pushes through the crowd, one hand resting on his greatsword. Three large wolves pace with him, iron collars around their necks; a huge cloaked figure follows, its heavy footfalls audible above the uproar.\n\nThe half-orc fixes his small eyes on the sheep. “That sheep is Master Noke’s... he desires to have it back.” Finethir stays close at your side, the ornate scroll still in his mouth. The pursuers have arrived, and the half-orc’s demand hangs between you. What do you do?",
      "event_id": 554,
      "citations": [
        {
          "page": 2,
