    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I stop hiding. I hand Finethir over to Guz and stand aside, then openly walk beside them as they leave. I ask Guz to take me to Noke.",
      "event_id": 557,
      "citations": [],
      "rules_edition": null,
      "ruling_citation_ids": [],
      "turn_id": null,
      "roll_status": null,
      "roll": null,
      "created_at": "2026-10-22T10:43:04.982008Z"
    },
    {
      "role": "dm",
      "content": "You stop hiding and place Finethir in Guz’s custody. The half-orc takes the sheep with him; the wolves pace alongside as the group sets off toward Noke’s home. You walk openly beside them, and Guz agrees to take you there.\n\nThe journey brings you to the approach to Noke’s home. Finethir remains with Guz, while the way ahead leads toward the place he described—the wizard’s former home, where Noke keeps the wand. What do you do as you reach it?",
      "event_id": 557,
