    {
      "role": "dm",
      "content": "You stop hiding and follow the route openly. The road gives way to a narrow, well-trodden track through a gap in the bushes, winding among tall oaks. Many overlapping prints mark the earth. Beyond them, the woodland is sparse and quiet.\n\nThe track continues ahead through the trees, but Noke’s home is not yet in view. What do you do?",
